00:45:57.000 --> 00:46:02.000
I think I'm asking about another wife.

00:46:02.000 --> 00:46:03.000
So are you currently?

00:46:03.000 --> 00:46:04.000
No.

00:46:04.000 --> 00:46:05.000
Okay.

00:46:05.000 --> 00:46:07.000
I think it's just not for me.

00:46:07.000 --> 00:46:08.000
Yeah.

00:46:08.000 --> 00:46:10.000
I've been married 29 years all together.

00:46:10.000 --> 00:46:12.000
And I just can't get a ring.

00:46:12.000 --> 00:46:16.000
25, 22, 14, 12, and 7.

00:46:16.000 --> 00:46:17.000
Yeah.

00:46:17.000 --> 00:46:18.000
Mm-hmm.

00:46:18.000 --> 00:46:19.000
Wow.

00:46:19.000 --> 00:46:20.000
Yeah.

00:46:20.000 --> 00:46:27.000
Well, I think we've come to that time where I can say to you,

00:46:27.000 --> 00:46:31.000
thank you so much for being here.

00:46:31.000 --> 00:46:32.000
My pleasure.

00:46:32.000 --> 00:46:34.000
And sharing your life with us.

00:46:34.000 --> 00:46:35.000
It's my pleasure.

00:46:35.000 --> 00:46:36.000
Thanks for having me.

00:46:36.000 --> 00:46:37.000
Thank you, John.

00:46:37.000 --> 00:46:38.000
Thanks a lot.

00:46:38.000 --> 00:46:42.000
And here we are again, back at the end of a story.

00:46:42.000 --> 00:46:46.000
There are many of them, and there will always be many.

00:46:46.000 --> 00:46:52.000
And hopefully the position that John has taken will bring him

00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:57.000
happiness and hopefully prosperity.

00:46:57.000 --> 00:46:59.000
Thank you for joining us.

00:46:59.000 --> 00:47:01.000
I'm Ken Weaver from Foresight.

00:47:01.000 --> 00:47:02.000
Until next time.

00:47:07.000 --> 00:47:08.000
Thank you.

